WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 49 - The Other
Half of My Soul

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:41.060
It's all right. I'm here.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.530
Hey!

00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.780
You little brat!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.020
Stop right there.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.350
He wants to take care
of that refugee?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:19.680
And how does that pauper of a playwright expect
to feed her when he's starving himself?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.150
I'm taking her in,

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:26.800
so I'll take full responsibility
for her life... for Chizu's life.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:42.300
It's all right, Chizu. I'm here.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.080
It's all right.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:50.390
Ma'am!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:50.980
Ma'am!

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.290
My lady!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.060
My lady!

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.500
Ma'am!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.580
Ma'am! Ma'am!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:11.590
Nine years after I was saved by up-and-coming
playwright, Ichiren Ozaki,

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:18.300
I was handed the starring role of a moon
goddess when I was just sixteen.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.950
At this point, your hand is taken by the
servant boy who has stolen your heart,

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.690
and you walk down
the stairs together.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:27.830
On the floor below, the man your parents
have chosen for you to marry.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:31.250
This is an irreplaceable
moment for both of you.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.430
So, one more time...

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.890
A love that must
be kept hidden.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:37.860
Your beating heart.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.040
Your shame.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:41.260
The two souls being
drawn to each other.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.950
Chizu!

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.800
That's it! That's
the expression!

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:54.810
I'm glad we met
nine years ago.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:04:00.760
Me too! If we hadn't met, I wouldn't
exist as I am today.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:06.370
This hand... I've been living
my life guided by this hand.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:13.680
There will come a day when you will
no longer want to be led by this hand.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.450
No! Never!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.520
You've grown into a beautiful
young lady, Chizu.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:24.510
The moonlight suits you.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:30.590
Ichiren gave me the stage
name: Chigusa Tsukikage.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:33.580
Where's Miss Ayaka?!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.020
Love made me shine.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:41.040
As an actress, I improved
greatly, but...

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.770
The love that could
never be...

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:50.320
I poured all my passion and the life
Ichiren had given me into theater.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:56.580
Ichiren started writing one masterpiece
after another and I acted in them.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:01.230
Everything was going well
until that fateful incident.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.700
Master, you have
to get out of here!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.510
This is my life!

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.010
Chigusa, please!
Save yourself!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:20.720
I won't leave you here!

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:33.360
After Ichiren disappeared, I went to
all the places he might have gone.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.970
Only his older sister was
able to give me a lead.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:40.740
It's a place we used to visit
when we were children.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:48.600
They say the plum trees bloom there all year
round, but nobody can cross its borders.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.520
This is where he lives?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.670
The Scarlet Angel

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.680
That was Ichiren's
newest play.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.430
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.430
Master Ichiren!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:19.860
Chigusa!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.600
Master!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.000
You are the Scarlet Angel!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.830
No one else can
play her but you!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.580
The Scarlet Angel?

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:35.150
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> was to be the Gekkou
Stage's first play after its grand reopening,

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.600
and Ichiren was stricter
than ever in rehearsals.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:44.520
When asked to depict fire, I acted
out <i>Yaoya Oshichi</i>.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:51.450
To me, that role was also my
confession of love to Ichiren.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.750
However...

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.730
You've passed the fire task.

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:02.660
He's completely ignoring
my feelings.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:06.930
To him, I'm just an actress.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:15.210
The only thing I could do was live
on stage as the Scarlet Angel.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:24.860
"I shall make the flowers of life bloom
for a thousand scarlet years!"

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:36.820
You are the conduit
of my soul.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.720
I will never let anyone
else play this role.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:41.930
Master.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:46.080
Chigusa, you are the
other half of my soul.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.250
I was connected to Ichiren...

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.530
with a bond that was
stronger than that...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.850
between lovers or spouses.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.840
The Gekkou Stage
The Scarlet Angel

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:59.250
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> brought
new life to the Gekkou Stage.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:04.390
But one day, a man appeared
in front of me.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:07.440
He claimed to be an
avid fan of mine.

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:11.400
As a professional in the
transportation business,

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.520
he was soon involved in supporting
Gekkou's regional ventures,

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:18.650
and he started buying up theaters and making
deals with movie businesses as well.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.380
His name was Eisuke
Hayami.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:27.260
His profit-driven model strongly
clashed with Ichiren's ideals,

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.880
and Ichiren finally cut
all ties with him.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:35.400
With Eisuke as an enemy, the
theater was plunged into crisis.

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:38.980
Eisuke, who had founded
Daito Entertainment,

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.980
began to plan the production
of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>,

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.740
but Ichiren wouldn't give him
the rights to the play.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:50.440
After the theater had been repossessed
as well, Ichiren fell ill.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:55.970
The troop disbanded and even his
wife and children abandoned him.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.000
You need to leave
me too, Chigusa.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.410
Master!

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.250
You're still young.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:07.440
There's no reason for you to get mixed up in my
affairs and jeopardize your career as an actress.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:13.940
I'm staying with you! One day, let's perform
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> again!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.430
The Gekkou Stage was certainly
a tough nut to crack, wasn't it?

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:21.730
Now I just have to obtain the rights
to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.280
All this was the fault
of that man.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.830
I won't let him get
away with this.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.720
I'll beat him all the way
down to Hell some day!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:33.290
I hated Eisuke Hayami
with my whole being.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.050
I'm very sorry for all of this.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.540
This is all because
you met me.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:44.310
No. I was born to meet you.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:45.840
Chigusa.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.990
I love you, Master Ichiren.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:53.500
You do?  But I can't
do anything for you.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.800
I don't need you to do anything for me. As long
as we're together, master, that's enough for me.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:03.510
Don't call me master anymore.
I am no longer your teacher.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.540
I love you, Ichiren!

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.560
My heart started to
race horribly.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.930
Ichiren took his life
by his own hand.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.980
He left me the rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.520
I want to be with Ichiren!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.350
Miss Chigusa, stop!

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:38.260
Who'll play the Scarlet
Angel if you're gone?!

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:43.080
You're the other half
of Ichiren's soul!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.770
Please! You must live on so you
can play the Scarlet Angel!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.770
I had to become strong.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:55.240
I found allies in the press and the financial world
who kept Eisuke Hayami away from me.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:58.300
I became a famous actress.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:02.920
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>
was all mine.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:09.570
Ichiren, we are two halves
of the same soul.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.380
You live on within me.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:25.820
You are the only one who can protect
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.030
Ichiren!

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.240
I'm counting on you, Chigusa.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.390
Wait!

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:34.840
Ichiren!

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.850
My lady!

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.350
I had a very long dream.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:02.070
They say that your life flashes before
your eyes just before you die.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.460
My lady.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.590
Don't worry, Genzo.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.770
Ichiren won't let me die yet.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:14.810
This was the spot where
I met Ichiren.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:19.180
The Valley of the Plums hasn't
changed at all since then,

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.050
but you, Ichiren...
you are gone.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.180
It's all right. I'm here.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:31.410
We are always together on
stage. Never forget that.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.320
Ichiren,

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:39.390
my hand has been in yours ever
since I was seven years old!

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:48.970
Wait and see, Ichiren. I'm going to train a
Scarlet Angel who can inherit your soul!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.530
Maya!

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.390
Hey!

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.340
Maya!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:06.230
Hey!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.160
What's going on?

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.810
You're all here!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.680
How's Ms. Tsukikage doing?

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.500
Is that why you came?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:19.000
We got a call last night from Mr.
Genzo. What's the news?

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.770
She's pulled through.
Somehow.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:30.020
"The tree is energy. The manifestation of the energy
of the god of the earth above ground?"

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:33.310
This is really tough stuff.

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:40.960
Ms. Tsukikage said that we should understand
the Scarlet Angel by now...

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.100
And do you?

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:54.020
"The song of God that connects heaven
and earth and fosters the orb of life."

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:58.630
I just don't know how these
lines should be acted.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:10.330
She's out having fun, instead
of rehearsing the role?

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:16.600
I made you worry,
but I'm fine now.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:20.170
So, how did you
rehearse today?

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:24.990
I was thinking about possible interpretations
for the lines you gave us.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:29.650
I was trying to understand the
Scarlet Angel's feelings, so...

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.680
Her feelings?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:40.160
Then, tell me: How does she feel when she says
the lines: "Who? Who is trying to wake me?"

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:45.390
Well, about being awoken...

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:50.540
the Scarlet Angel has the
power to hear that voice.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.310
And you, Ayumi?

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:57.990
I interpreted it as the scent of battle
awakening the Scarlet Angel.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.940
Ayumi, as an actor, you
have the role down.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:07.080
But you're still far from capturing
the real spirit of the role.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.340
Maya,

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:13.090
your weak spot happens to put you
right into the role.

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:17.440
But I can't exactly call your
performance acting,

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.880
because you've made yourself
the focal point.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:23.650
Actors do not act
for themselves.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.930
I want you to be more aware
of the audience's presence.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.320
Yes.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:42.240
Maya, I underestimated you.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:49.100
I'm trying to get closer to the Scarlet Angel,
but you're thinking <i>as her</i>!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.460
The gap between us
is just so huge!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.010
Good morning!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:56.930
Yo!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:00.140
What are you all doing here?

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:07.170
Welcome to the Valley
of the Plums!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:12.650
I called everyone together to ask you to
go out and play as if you were spirits.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.720
You are all going to be spirits who protect this
hallowed ground with the Scarlet Angel.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:24.560
What do you think they'd do to protect
this hallowed place from humans?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:29.480
I'm going to be a mist spirit, protecting the
area by hiding the roads that lead to it!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:34.480
I'll be an echo! I'll echo their voices
back to them until they get lost!

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:38.150
Ryuujin will summon the storm
clouds to bring rain!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:40.730
I'll chase them out of
the valley as an ogre!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:45.010
And then, I'll whisk them away
in the river as a water spirit!

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:47.540
Everyone looks like
they're having fun!

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:53.380
Right now, the Scarlet Angel
is in a deep sleep.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:59.710
Even though the other spirits will start stirring
on my first signal, you can't move yet.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.060
Go and find a spot you like.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.370
Yes, ma'am.

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:08.050
You'll awaken on my second signal.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.560
I am a plum tree.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.340
I am the spirit of
the plum tree.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.740
It's warm.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.330
It's like I can hear the
tree's heartbeat.

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:30.390
Morning!

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:32.270
Morning!

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.170
Oh, it's you, Echo.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.430
Echo!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.690
Go away!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.470
Go away! Go away!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.760
Oh yeah?!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.150
Oh yeah?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.100
I've been stood here
like this for so long.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.670
When is Ms. Tsukikage going
to give the signal?

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:57.660
What's with her expression?

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:00.060
She looks like she's asleep!

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:04.040
Look at this, Genzo.

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:09.530
As time passes, Ayumi starts to focus
on her heart more and more,

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:13.520
whereas Maya forgets her
own more and more.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.140
The Scarlet Angel's...

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.160
...signal.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:41.080
"What's going on?"

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.460
"I can't move my body."

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.540
"The tree is energy."

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:02.000
"The manifestation of the energy of
the god of the earth above ground."

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:05.170
"This is hallowed ground."

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.510
"This plum tree is my body."

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:13.270
"My power becomes a helix, and
then ascends into the skies...

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:18.090
to raise the creatures of the earth,
the creatures of the water."

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:25.640
"I shall make the flowers of life bloom
for a thousand scarlet years!"

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.090
My lady!

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:36.320
This isn't a spirit...
this is a goddess!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.760
I can't keep up.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:43.440
No matter how much I practice and how much
effort I put in, I can't keep up with this girl.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:47.690
What just happened?

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:51.920
I feel like a huge amount of energy
just raced through my body.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.350
Was that the Scarlet Angel?

00:19:55.430 --> 00:20:01.540
I can't beat you, Maya
Kitajima. Ever.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:09.390
Ms. Tsukikage, I'm sorry I'm running
away without even saying goodbye.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.670
I'll write a letter to you when
I arrive back in Tokyo.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:16.560
I didn't think my eternal dream
would end like this.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:21.070
But I can't stand being
depressed any more.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.850
This will be the last time
I ever come here.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.050
Don't cross that bridge!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.810
There are parts of it that have
rotted away in the middle.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.580
But they crossed over
fine just yesterday!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:43.060
Well, you can't really see the damage from here,
but my foot broke through one of the boards...

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.870
and I almost fell through!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.480
I can't believe I can't
cross this bridge.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.970
But going back will only
open more wounds.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:07.040
I felt so strange when I was acting
yesterday. I want to act again...

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:11.230
I want to act as the Scarlet
Angel in that valley again.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:15.620
No!

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:23.550
If she crosses that bridge...

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.720
The Scarlet Angel will be...

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:33.470
I just need to keep quiet.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.730
I don't know anything!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.810
I don't know about...

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:44.840
the bridge...

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.010
or that she even
came this way!

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
I can go anywhere... One life.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:26.220
Maya Kitajima. You're
always ahead of me.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:32.120
You walk all over my endless hours of practice
and effort and surpass me in an instant.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:35.100
How futile everything is.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:38.400
It feels like everything I've achieved
my whole life has been for nothing!

00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:40.460
I hate you!

00:23:40.460 --> 00:23:44.630
I hate you for making
me feel like this!

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:49.480
I know you're thinking about taking everything
away from me, but I'm not letting you have...

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 50 - The
Mask of the Goddess

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.510
the Scarlet Angel!
